        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1656_6035.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fr</unclear>: willig dienst, und was wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eeren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liebs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>guots vermögen zuvor fromen fürsichtig ersam und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wiß</unclear>, In-
<lb n="3"/>sonders lieben und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründten</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Was</unclear> e: e: w: uns unnderm dato den <date resp="#ner">28 augusti</date> jüngsthin
<lb n="5"/>Wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlengerung</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vonwilerisch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbtheilung</unclear>, wie
<lb n="6"/>auch umb abschrifft der fr: <persName resp="#ner">Elsbeth von Vonwil</persName> selig
<lb n="7"/>ufgerichten testaments <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschriben</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habendt</unclear> wir zuo rächter zeit empfangen undt innhaltß
<lb n="9"/>ablesende wol verstanden, fuegen denselben In ant-
<lb n="10"/>wurt hinwiderumb fründtlich zuvernemmen, dß
<lb n="11"/>wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> E. e: w: begeren
<lb n="12"/>gemeß die berüerte erbtheilung gern umb etwas
<lb n="13"/>zeit verschoben heten, So haben aber
<lb n="14"/>iedoch die alhieige erben wie auch e. e. w. mitburgerin
<lb n="15"/>die fraw <persName resp="#ner">Felin</persName> umb willen daß man wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Infallenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herbsts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allenthalben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>vil <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thün</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schaffen</unclear> sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßen</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>zum höchsten beschwert, und eß bij deme <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schon</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">albereith</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernanten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bestimbten</unclear> tag verbleiben zuo laßen
<lb n="20"/>uns gantz trungenlich gebeten, welcheß wir Inen auß
<lb n="21"/>erhebl. ursachen nit verweigeren, sonderen den bestimbten
<lb n="22"/>theilungs tag, (zuo welchem wir neben e. e. w. ver-
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ordneten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">theil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vogt</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herrn</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schindlers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verordnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werdent</unclear>)
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gotes</unclear> Namen für gehen laßen wöllen,
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Beinebenß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">um</unclear> die copi von der fraw
<lb n="27"/><persName resp="#ner">Vonwilerin</persName> selig, gemachten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">testamentß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuot</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anbe</unclear>-
<lb n="28"/>langen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sollendt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">w</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewüßlich</unclear> ver-
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1656_6036.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kuenen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> wir selbige ihe und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dotorn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schmaltz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">testaments</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ain</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abschrift</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinuß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegeben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eben</unclear> so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wichtige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wo</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wichtigere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ursach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dr</unclear>.
<lb n="33"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">H</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schmaltz</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">6</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jarn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehebt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dorn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schmaltzn</unclear> testament
<lb n="35"/>vor 6 Jaren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">were</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">copialich</unclear> communicirt
<lb n="36"/>worden, solte wol der fr. <persName resp="#ner">Elizabeth von
<lb n="37"/>Ranzow</persName> gemachtes testament gar under-
<lb n="38"/>laßen worden, unnd also diße sach schoun
<lb n="39"/>richtig undt verglichen sin, daß unß
<lb n="40"/>auch daß H. Schmaltz testament <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuevor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear>
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sinbl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschrifft</unclear> fideliter solle mitgetheilt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>,
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hette</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erachtens</unclear> durch den notarium,
<lb n="43"/>der solches uffgericht schoun albereit beschehen,
<lb n="44"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dargegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ranzowische</unclear> testament auch
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinnber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schickhen</unclear>, unnd E. E. W. und wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear>
<lb n="46"/>allen theiln <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befridigt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khuenen</unclear>, wie
<lb n="47"/>wir unß dan noch dahin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbieten</unclear> so bald unß daß
<lb n="48"/>Schmaltzisch testament zuegeschickht wirt, wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">In</unclear>
<lb n="49"/>mit in continenti daß Ranzowisch testament
<lb n="50"/>auch hinuß geben und volgen laßen wellen, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">also</unclear>
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jenige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> nun lange Zit
<lb n="52"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jar</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">here</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebruchte</unclear> und continuirte Nachbar-
<lb n="53"/>liche correspondentz gern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fortpflantzen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear>, mit
<lb n="54"/>hilff deß allmecht. In deßen gnadenrichen schutz und
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schirm</unclear> wir unß hiemit samptlich beuelch thue
<lb n="56"/>datum <origDate when="1609-09-20" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">20</unclear> septembris a° 1609</origDate>.
<lb n="57"/>An die <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Crantz</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="58"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">B. und Rath der
<lb n="59"/>Statt Sant Gallen</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1656_6037.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1656_6038.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">An</unclear> <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-32" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuerich</unclear></origPlace> <origDate when="1609" resp="#ner">2. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">7b</unclear>. 1609</origDate>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weg</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ikonwills</unclear></persName>
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbtheilung</unclear>.
</p>
